parakeet-redux-onnx
===================

A GitHub mirror of the Hugging Face repo:

    https://huggingface.co/eschmidbauer/parakeet-redux-onnx

Model lineage (all CC BY 4.0):

  - nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3
        Base model. Copyright NVIDIA Corporation.
        https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3

  - moondream/parakeet-redux
        1.58-bit (ternary) version of the above. Copyright Moondream.
        https://huggingface.co/moondream/parakeet-redux

  - eschmidbauer/parakeet-redux-onnx
        ONNX export of parakeet-redux for ONNX Runtime inference without
        PyTorch (ternary weights repacked as 4-bit MatMulNBits blocks), plus
        transcribe.py / export_onnx.py and the other support files.
        By eschmidbauer. As stated on the upstream model card: neither
        moondream nor NVIDIA endorse this export.

This mirror (github.com/chemcoder-2020/parakeet-redux-onnx) contains
byte-identical copies of the files from the source repo above. Checksums in
README.md / checksums.txt were verified against the source repo after
download. The upstream model card is preserved verbatim in SOURCE-CARD.md.

